he communication and attention concerns through targeted onboarding. I therefore maintain my provisional recommendation for Candidate\u202fB, while urging us to probe further into Candidates\u202fC and\u202fD\u2019s stress resilience, technical competence, and crew\u2011cooperation behaviors before finalizing."}
